1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,150
Davis, W. Va. voted 5–0 against a data
center.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:09,200
West Virginia’s HB 2014: certified data
centers skip town rules.

3
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:14,650
Who wrote HB 2014? An engineer at
Fundamental Data says: his company did.

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:20,150
The company and the governor deny it. The
Speaker of the House is its lawyer.

5
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:25,450
The town said no. Once certified, the data
center won’t need its yes.
